Article 4 (Documents for Applications for Approval of Authorized Personnel)
Where a superintendent of education seeks approval for the establishment of authorized personnel under Article 15-2 or 16 of the Decree, the superintendent shall submit the following documents to the Minister of Education: <Amended on March 23, 2013; May 20, 2013; and March 9, 2018.>
1. A proposed plan for establishing an organization;
2. A personnel management plan (including the current staffing status, required personnel, allocation of duties and personnel expenses);
3. Results of job analysis for the relevant positions;
4. Draft enactments or amendments of municipal ordinances and rules concerning the establishment of organizations and authorized personnel.
